OL,3,GNEWSARob Brydon's battle to stay in
OL,4,Acharacter playing Peter O'Toole
OL,5,
OL,6,FActor and comedian Rob Brydon has said
OL,7,Fit was difficult to stay in character
OL,8,Fwhile playing the role of a legendary
OL,9,Factor portraying a man who was
OL,10,Ffrequently too hungover to do his job.
OL,12,FHe was speaking to BBC Radio 4's Today
OL,13,Fprogramme about his role in new radio
OL,14,Fdrama, Peter O'Toole Is Unwell.
OL,16,FIt encompasses O'Toole's critically
OL,17,Facclaimed stage role in Jeffrey Bernard
OL,18,Fis Unwell in the West End in 1999,
OL,19,Falong with his universally panned
OL,20,Fperformance of Macbeth in 1980.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
