OL,3,GNEWSARob Brydon's battle to stay in
OL,4,Acharacter playing Peter O'Toole
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrydon, who grew up in Baglan, Port
OL,7,FTalbot, said taking on the role "felt
OL,8,Flike a challenge once we got into the
OL,9,Fstudio" and he battled "to stay on the
OL,10,Fsaddle" to remain in character.
